-- =====================================================================
-- Manual seed coverage notes
-- =====================================================================
-- Requested login emails included:
-- admin@fpt.edu.vn, ho@fpt.edu.vn, staff.leader.hn@fpt.edu.vn,
-- staff.hn@fpt.edu.vn, dept.leader.hn@fpt.edu.vn, dept.hn@fpt.edu.vn,
-- student@fpt.edu.vn, visitor@example.com.
--
-- Visit coverage:
-- - Single-campus: pending, rejected, assigned, before, during, after, closed,
--   visitor-cancelled, host-cancelled campus instance.
-- - Multi-campus: pending campus-level approval, rejected by HO, waiting host assignment,
--   assigned, before, during, after, closed, partial campus cancellation,
--   visitor-cancelled total request.
--
-- Visibility expectations:
-- - HO sees only MULTI_CAMPUS via vw_visit_requests_for_ho.
-- - Staff Leader HN sees SINGLE_CAMPUS HN and released HN instances of MULTI_CAMPUS.
-- - Staff HN sees assigned/linked host instances through current_host_user_id/participants.
-- - Department HN sees assigned logistics/department support rows.
-- - Student sees invited/assigned student participant rows.
-- - Visitor sees own requests through visitor_user_id = 8.
-- - Admin visit view must return zero rows.
-- =====================================================================



